-- allium: 3
--
-- Pachinko — the root module
--
-- Scope
--   The domain of this repository is not yet defined. This module is where
--   it will be: the first specification change that names a behaviour
--   states it here, or in a module this one imports, before any code in
--   crates/libpachinko or crates/pachinko implements it.
--
-- Includes
--   Nothing yet. The module declares no entity, rule, surface or invariant.
--
-- Excludes
--   - Every behaviour, until a specification change defines one.
--
-- Dependencies
--   None. No other module exists for this one to import.
--
-- Vocabulary
--   None yet. The words of the domain are fixed here when the domain is.
